  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Communication, media and promotion for Water as Leverage Cartagena &#x2013; Construyendo con el Agua</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This assignment focuses on communication-, media- and promotion-related activities for the trajectory &apos;Water as Leverage Cartagena &#x2013; Construyendo con el Agua&apos; (hereafter: WaL Cartagena).It is the ambition to involve a team of experts to capture the activities and development of the narrative of WaL Cartagena, both during key events such as workshops, but also during on-the-ground activities of other involved stakeholders as part of the trajectory. This should result in outputs, such as social media material, videos, photos, articles.These outputs should support the Government of the Netherlands, the Alcald&#xed;a de Cartagena and other key counterpart organisations to use coherent and professional communication materials of the WaL Cartagena trajectory.</narrative>
  </description>
